                <pb facs="0179" n="135" sameAs="frus:frus1952-54v05p1/pg135"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>No official NATO record of this meeting has been
                    found in Department of State files, and no list of participants is available.
                    Secretary of Defense Lovett
                    presumably headed the United States Delegation at this meeting. The telegraphic
                    report printed <hi rendition="#italic">infra</hi> is the only record of the
                    meeting available to the editors.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
